  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO Empowering Local Radio with ICTs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNESCO Empowering Local Radio with ICTs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projektet skall ge st&#xf6;d till lokala radiostationer i Afrika s&#xf6;der om  Sahara i deras anv&#xe4;ndande av ICT i kombination med radios&#xe4;ndning f&#xf6;r  att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra fattiga m&#xe4;nniskors, s&#xe4;rskilt kvinnor och flickors,      tillg&#xe5;ng till information och kommunikation p&#xe5; f&#xf6;r dessa s&#xe4;rskilt     intressanta omr&#xe5;den som h&#xe4;lsa och jordbruk.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">This project shall support Subsaharan African local radio stations&#xb4;   use of ICT combined with broadcasting in order to provide local       populations with information and communication in areas of primary    interest for poor people in the countryside, especially women and     girls.</narrative>
  </description>
